{
  "app_id": 821250,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Turn ocean garbage into homes, workshops and colorful little gardens. Collect floating plastic and driftwood, salvage scraps of the old world, and recycle them into homes that stay afloat. Desalinate water, gut fish and board up a shelter to keep everyone safe Decorate your town with plants, refurbished furniture and statues that keep your drifters happy. Set sail to explore the flooded world, from soaked ruins to forgotten islands, and discover what still floats beyond the horizon. Explore flooded remnants of the old world Rescue stranded survivors and friendly animals Re-discover old technology to improve your town. But be careful your drifters don’t get sick. The old world is polluted! Your drifters each have their own stories to tell. Recruit specialists who unlock new buildings, quests, and discoveries for your floating community. Find unique drifters like the Birdkeeper, Chemist, and Electrician Unlock new technologies and story quests through their expertise Complete personal storylines to unlock new mechanics Develop cleaner, smarter systems that turn waste into progress and keep your floating town thriving in this feel-good apocalypse. Research new tech to transition from burning firewood to green eel-ectricity generation. Build connected production pipelines that turn your floating town into a self-sustaining ecosystem. Clean food and develop cures for pollution-born diseases and keep your drifters healthy and productive",
    "zh-Hant": "建造你的漂浮家園 將海洋垃圾變成房屋、工坊和色彩繽紛的小花園。 收集漂浮的塑膠和浮木，打撈舊世界的廢料，將它們回收利用，製成可以漂浮的房屋。 將海水脫鹽，清理魚的內臟，用木板搭建一個避難所，以保證大家的安全 用植物、翻新的家具和雕像裝飾你的城鎮，讓你的漂泊者們心情愉悅。 與你的城鎮一起遨遊海洋 揚帆起航，探索被洪水淹沒的世界，從海水浸泡的廢墟到被遺忘的島嶼，探索地平線外還有什麼漂浮在水上。 探索被洪水淹沒的舊世界遺跡 營救被困的倖存者和友好的動物 重新發現舊科技來提升你的城鎮。但要小心，不要讓你的漂泊者感染疾病，因為舊世界已被污染了！ 結識獨特的漂泊者與專業人士 你的每個漂泊者都有自己的故事。招募專業人士，為你的漂浮社群解鎖新的建築、任務和發現。 尋找獨特的漂泊者，例如養鳥人、化學家和電工 利用他們的專業知識，解鎖新技術和劇情任務 完成個人故事線以解鎖新機制 回收、研究和再創新 開發更清潔、更智慧的系統，利用廢料進行生產，讓你的漂浮城鎮在這個感覺還不錯的末日世界中繁榮發展。 研究新技術，從燃燒木柴過渡到鰻魚發電這樣的綠色能源。 建立彼此連結的生產管道，將你的漂浮城鎮變成一個自給自足的生態系統。 清理食物，研究污染病的治療方法，讓你的漂泊者保持健康，提高生產力",
    "zh-Hans": "建造你的漂浮家园 将海洋垃圾变成房屋、工坊和色彩缤纷的小花园。 收集漂浮的塑料和浮木，打捞旧世界的废料，将它们回收利用，制成可以漂浮的房屋。 对海水进行淡化，清理鱼内脏，用木板搭建一个避难所，以保证每个人的安全 用植物、翻新的家具和雕像装饰你的城镇，让你的漂泊者们心情愉悦。 与你的城镇一起遨游海洋 扬帆起航，探索被洪水淹没的世界，从海水浸泡的废墟到被遗忘的岛屿，探索地平线外还有什么漂浮在水上。 探索被洪水淹没的旧世界遗迹 营救被困的幸存者和友好的动物 重新发现旧科技来改善你的城镇。但要小心，不要让你的漂泊者感染疾病，因为旧世界已被污染了！ 结识独特的漂泊者和专家 你的每个漂泊者都有自己的故事。招募专家，为你的漂浮社区解锁新的建筑、任务和发现。 寻找独特的漂泊者，例如养鸟人、化学家和电工 利用他们的专业知识解锁新技术和剧情任务 完成个人故事线以解锁新机制 回收、研究和再创新 开发更清洁、更智能的系统，变废为宝，让你的漂浮城镇在这个感觉还不错的末日世界中繁荣发展。 研究新技术，从燃烧木柴过渡到鳗鱼发电这种绿色能源。 建立相互连接的生产管道，将你的漂浮城镇变成一个自给自足的生态系统。 清理食物，研究污染病的治疗方法，让你的漂泊者保持健康，提高生产力",
    "ja": "浮かぶ町を築こう 海に浮かぶゴミを集めて、住まいや作業場や色とりどりの小さな庭を設けましょう。 プラスチックや流木を回収し、洪水前の世界の廃材をリサイクルして浮かぶ家を建てましょう。 海水を淡水に変換し、魚を調理しシェルターを補強して、仲間を守りましょう。 植物、修理した家具や像で町を飾り、漂流者たちを笑顔にしましょう。 町で航海しよう 海底に眠る遺跡や未開の島々など水没した世界を探検しながら、水平線の向こうの漂流物を見に行きましょう。 かつての世界の名残を探しましょう。 孤立した生存者や動物を救出しましょう。 かつての技術を再発見して町を発展させましょう。でも水中にあるものはどれも汚染されているので、注意して！ 個性豊かな漂流者たち 漂流者は、それぞれ異なるバックグラウンドを持っています。専門家を迎えて、新たな建物や、クエストや、発見をアンロックしましょう。 鳥の飼育者、化学者、電気技師など、様々な漂流者が登場。 彼らの専門知識を活かして、新たな技術や物語のクエストをアンロックしましょう。 それぞれのストーリーラインを進めると、新しいメカニクスがアンロックされます。 リサイクル、研究、再発明 希望の残る終末の世界で、廃棄物を進歩へと変える、クリーンでスマートな仕組みを築き上げましょう。 木材の燃料から脱却すべく、デンキウナギによる発電などのグリーンエネルギーを研究して持続可能な町づくりをしましょう。 生産施設を連結して、完全自給自足の漂流エコシステムを作り出しましょう。 食材を浄化し、汚染による病を治癒して、漂流者たちの健康と町の活気を守りましょう。",
    "ko": "떠다니는 나만의 집 만들기 바다 위에 떠다니는 쓰레기를 집, 작업장, 그리고 알록달록한 작은 정원으로 바꿔보세요. 떠다니는 플라스틱과 표류목을 모으고, 잊혀진 구세계의 잔해를 수거해 떠다니는 집으로 재활용하세요. 바닷물을 담수화하고, 물고기를 손질하고, 피난처를 지어 모두의 안전을 확보하세요. 식물, 복원된 가구, 조각상으로 드리프터들을 행복하게 해 주세요. 마을을 타고 바다를 여행하자 대홍수 이후의 세계를 항해하며 탐험하세요. 물에 잠긴 폐허부터 잊혀진 섬까지, 지평선 너머에 아직 남은 것들을 발견해 보세요. 물에 잠긴 구세계의 흔적을 탐험하세요. 조난당한 생존자와 친근한 동물들을 구조하세요. 오래된 기술을 다시 발견해 마을을 발전시키세요. 하지만 드리프터들이 아프지 않도록 해야 합니다. 구세계는 오염되었으니까요! 개성 있는 드리프터와 전문가들 만나기 떠도는 이들은 모두 자기만의 이야기가 있습니다. 전문가들을 고용해 새로운 건물, 퀘스트를 잠금 해제하고 떠다니는 마을에 필요한 새로운 기술을 발견하세요. 새 조련사, 화학자, 전기공같은 특별한 드리프터들을 찾아보세요. 이들의 전문 기술을 이용해 새로운 기술과 스토리 퀘스트를 잠금 해제하세요. 사람들의 스토리라인을 완성해 새로운 메커닉을 획득하세요. 재활용하고, 연구하고, 다시 발명하기 쓰레기를 원동력으로 바꾸는 보다 깨끗하고 똑똑한 시스템을 개발하고 떠다니는 마을을 아늑한 아포칼립스의 낙원으로 만들어 보세요. 새로운 기술을 연구해 목탄 발전에서 자연 친화적인 장어전기 발전 시스템으로 진화시키세요. 생산 파이프라인을 연동해 떠다니는 마을을 자급자족 가능한 환경으로 꾸며보세요. 깨끗한 음식과 오염병의 치료제를 만들어 주민들을 건강하고 생산적이게 해주세요."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn ocean garbage into homes, workshops and colorful little gardens.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect floating plastic and driftwood, salvage scraps of the old world, and recycle them into homes that stay afloat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desalinate water, gut fish and board up a shelter to keep everyone safe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your town with plants, refurbished furniture and statues that keep your drifters happy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail to explore the flooded world, from soaked ruins to forgotten islands, and discover what still floats beyond the horizon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore flooded remnants of the old world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue stranded survivors and friendly animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-discover old technology to improve your town. But be careful your drifters don’t get sick. The old world is polluted!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drifters each have their own stories to tell. Recruit specialists who unlock new buildings, quests, and discoveries for your floating community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique drifters like the Birdkeeper, Chemist, and Electrician</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies and story quests through their expertise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete personal storylines to unlock new mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop cleaner, smarter systems that turn waste into progress and keep your floating town thriving in this feel-good apocalypse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new tech to transition from burning firewood to green eel-ectricity generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build connected production pipelines that turn your floating town into a self-sustaining ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean food and develop cures for pollution-born diseases and keep your drifters healthy and productive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建造你的漂浮家園</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >將海洋垃圾變成房屋、工坊和色彩繽紛的小花園。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集漂浮的塑膠和浮木，打撈舊世界的廢料，將它們回收利用，製成可以漂浮的房屋。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >將海水脫鹽，清理魚的內臟，用木板搭建一個避難所，以保證大家的安全</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用植物、翻新的家具和雕像裝飾你的城鎮，讓你的漂泊者們心情愉悅。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與你的城鎮一起遨遊海洋</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >揚帆起航，探索被洪水淹沒的世界，從海水浸泡的廢墟到被遺忘的島嶼，探索地平線外還有什麼漂浮在水上。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索被洪水淹沒的舊世界遺跡</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >營救被困的倖存者和友好的動物</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重新發現舊科技來提升你的城鎮。但要小心，不要讓你的漂泊者感染疾病，因為舊世界已被污染了！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >結識獨特的漂泊者與專業人士</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的每個漂泊者都有自己的故事。招募專業人士，為你的漂浮社群解鎖新的建築、任務和發現。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >尋找獨特的漂泊者，例如養鳥人、化學家和電工</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用他們的專業知識，解鎖新技術和劇情任務</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完成個人故事線以解鎖新機制</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >回收、研究和再創新</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >開發更清潔、更智慧的系統，利用廢料進行生產，讓你的漂浮城鎮在這個感覺還不錯的末日世界中繁榮發展。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >研究新技術，從燃燒木柴過渡到鰻魚發電這樣的綠色能源。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建立彼此連結的生產管道，將你的漂浮城鎮變成一個自給自足的生態系統。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >清理食物，研究污染病的治療方法，讓你的漂泊者保持健康，提高生產力</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hans": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建造你的漂浮家园</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将海洋垃圾变成房屋、工坊和色彩缤纷的小花园。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集漂浮的塑料和浮木，打捞旧世界的废料，将它们回收利用，制成可以漂浮的房屋。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >对海水进行淡化，清理鱼内脏，用木板搭建一个避难所，以保证每个人的安全</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用植物、翻新的家具和雕像装饰你的城镇，让你的漂泊者们心情愉悦。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >与你的城镇一起遨游海洋</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扬帆起航，探索被洪水淹没的世界，从海水浸泡的废墟到被遗忘的岛屿，探索地平线外还有什么漂浮在水上。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索被洪水淹没的旧世界遗迹</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >营救被困的幸存者和友好的动物</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重新发现旧科技来改善你的城镇。但要小心，不要让你的漂泊者感染疾病，因为旧世界已被污染了！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >结识独特的漂泊者和专家</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的每个漂泊者都有自己的故事。招募专家，为你的漂浮社区解锁新的建筑、任务和发现。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >寻找独特的漂泊者，例如养鸟人、化学家和电工</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用他们的专业知识解锁新技术和剧情任务</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完成个人故事线以解锁新机制</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >回收、研究和再创新</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >开发更清洁、更智能的系统，变废为宝，让你的漂浮城镇在这个感觉还不错的末日世界中繁荣发展。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >研究新技术，从燃烧木柴过渡到鳗鱼发电这种绿色能源。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建立相互连接的生产管道，将你的漂浮城镇变成一个自给自足的生态系统。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >清理食物，研究污染病的治疗方法，让你的漂泊者保持健康，提高生产力</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ja": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >浮かぶ町を築こう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >海に浮かぶゴミを集めて、住まいや作業場や色とりどりの小さな庭を設けましょう。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >プラスチックや流木を回収し、洪水前の世界の廃材をリサイクルして浮かぶ家を建てましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >海水を淡水に変換し、魚を調理しシェルターを補強して、仲間を守りましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >植物、修理した家具や像で町を飾り、漂流者たちを笑顔にしましょう。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >町で航海しよう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >海底に眠る遺跡や未開の島々など水没した世界を探検しながら、水平線の向こうの漂流物を見に行きましょう。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >かつての世界の名残を探しましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >孤立した生存者や動物を救出しましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >かつての技術を再発見して町を発展させましょう。でも水中にあるものはどれも汚染されているので、注意して！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >個性豊かな漂流者たち</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >漂流者は、それぞれ異なるバックグラウンドを持っています。専門家を迎えて、新たな建物や、クエストや、発見をアンロックしましょう。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >鳥の飼育者、化学者、電気技師など、様々な漂流者が登場。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >彼らの専門知識を活かして、新たな技術や物語のクエストをアンロックしましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >それぞれのストーリーラインを進めると、新しいメカニクスがアンロックされます。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >リサイクル、研究、再発明</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望の残る終末の世界で、廃棄物を進歩へと変える、クリーンでスマートな仕組みを築き上げましょう。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >木材の燃料から脱却すべく、デンキウナギによる発電などのグリーンエネルギーを研究して持続可能な町づくりをしましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >生産施設を連結して、完全自給自足の漂流エコシステムを作り出しましょう。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >食材を浄化し、汚染による病を治癒して、漂流者たちの健康と町の活気を守りましょう。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ko": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >떠다니는 나만의 집 만들기</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >바다 위에 떠다니는 쓰레기를 집, 작업장, 그리고 알록달록한 작은 정원으로 바꿔보세요.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >떠다니는 플라스틱과 표류목을 모으고, 잊혀진 구세계의 잔해를 수거해 떠다니는 집으로 재활용하세요.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >바닷물을 담수화하고, 물고기를 손질하고, 피난처를 지어 모두의 안전을 확보하세요.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >식물, 복원된 가구, 조각상으로 드리프터들을 행복하게 해 주세요.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >마을을 타고 바다를 여행하자 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >대홍수 이후의 세계를 항해하며 탐험하세요. 물에 잠긴 폐허부터 잊혀진 섬까지, 지평선 너머에 아직 남은 것들을 발견해 보세요. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >물에 잠긴 구세계의 흔적을 탐험하세요. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >조난당한 생존자와 친근한 동물들을 구조하세요. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >오래된 기술을 다시 발견해 마을을 발전시키세요. 하지만 드리프터들이 아프지 않도록 해야 합니다. 구세계는 오염되었으니까요!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >개성 있는 드리프터와 전문가들 만나기</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >떠도는 이들은 모두 자기만의 이야기가 있습니다. 전문가들을 고용해 새로운 건물, 퀘스트를 잠금 해제하고 떠다니는 마을에 필요한 새로운 기술을 발견하세요.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >새 조련사, 화학자, 전기공같은 특별한 드리프터들을 찾아보세요.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >이들의 전문 기술을 이용해 새로운 기술과 스토리 퀘스트를 잠금 해제하세요.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >사람들의 스토리라인을 완성해 새로운 메커닉을 획득하세요.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >재활용하고, 연구하고, 다시 발명하기</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >쓰레기를 원동력으로 바꾸는 보다 깨끗하고 똑똑한 시스템을 개발하고 떠다니는 마을을 아늑한 아포칼립스의 낙원으로 만들어 보세요.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >새로운 기술을 연구해 목탄 발전에서 자연 친화적인 장어전기 발전 시스템으로 진화시키세요.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >생산 파이프라인을 연동해 떠다니는 마을을 자급자족 가능한 환경으로 꾸며보세요.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >깨끗한 음식과 오염병의 치료제를 만들어 주민들을 건강하고 생산적이게 해주세요.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1776454266\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1776454266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>"
  }
}
